Package: clipboard-history
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Arzdaniel12 <danielrzu208@gmail.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-gdkpixbuf-2.0
Description: Local clipboard history manager for Debian
 Clipboard History stores up to 100 text and image clipboard entries locally
 and provides a GTK search window for copying them again.
